issue_context.body:
Planning of queries with LIMIT + SORT + MV_EXPAND fails with `IllegalArgumentException`

```
row a = 1 | limit 1 | sort a | mv_expand a
```

```
{
    "error": {
        "root_cause": [
            {
                "type": "esql_illegal_argument_exception",
                "reason": "unknown physical plan node [OrderExec]"
            }
        ],
        "type": "esql_illegal_argument_exception",
        "reason": "unknown physical plan node [OrderExec]"
    },
    "status": 500
```

A similar problem was already [reported](https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/99971) and fixed, but it seems the fix is not complete.
